"column":75,"offset":1045}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Join our community to share your ideas, implementations and get help","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":4,"offset":1050},"end":{"line":21,"column":72,"offset":1118}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":4,"offset":1050},"end":{"line":21,"column":72,"offset":1118}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1,"offset":1047},"end":{"line":21,"column":72,"offset":1118}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1,"offset":831},"end":{"line":21,"column":72,"offset":1118}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":22,"column":1,"offset":1120}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Conclusion\r\n\r\nCongratulations! You've completed the Tokens on Solana course. You now have a solid understanding of how tokens work on Solana and their role.\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"What you've learned\" id=\"what-you-learned\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nThroughout this course, you've gained essential knowledge about:\r\n- The different type of tokens and why are they important.\r\n- How tokens work on Solana compared to other ecosystems.\r\n- What is a Mint, Token and Associated Token account.\r\n- What actions can be performed on this tokens.\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Next Steps\" id=\"next-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nYou're now ready to start using the new token program and extensions to superpower your programs! Here are some recommended next steps:\r\n\r\n1. Learn more about how you can use this program with typescript in the [SPL-Token with Web3Js section](/en/courses/spl-token-with-web3js)\r\n2. Explore the [Challenges section](/en/challenges) for hands-on exercises\r\n3. Join our community to share your ideas, implementations and get help\r\n","highlightedCode":{}}